{"id":"150af883bccb8887","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-phi-e.md","title":"Universal Turing Machine Encoding","display":"df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Encoding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-phi-e","aliases":["57-df-phi-e","df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Encoding"],"display":"df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Encoding","depends_on":["[[90-df-recursive-function]]","[[90-df-normal-form-theorem]]","[[90-df-min-operator]]","[[90-df-min-operator-generalized]]","[[90-df-halt-notation]]","[[57-df-omega]]","[[90-df-program-numbering]]","[[90-df-t-predicate]]","[[90-df-machine-coding]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-phi-e"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-phi-e</span><span>df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Encoding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8105afc544202519\" href=\"?note=8105afc544202519\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function\">90-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73df8af25850d4b3\" href=\"?note=73df8af25850d4b3\" title=\"90-df-normal-form-theorem\">90-df-normal-form-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65cecff06a8bc84e\" href=\"?note=65cecff06a8bc84e\" title=\"90-df-min-operator\">90-df-min-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"523fadf1703582fe\" href=\"?note=523fadf1703582fe\" title=\"90-df-min-operator-generalized\">90-df-min-operator-generalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"725681f54d4cc140\" href=\"?note=725681f54d4cc140\" title=\"90-df-halt-notation\">90-df-halt-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a630d8a1dcde994c\" href=\"?note=a630d8a1dcde994c\" title=\"57-df-omega\">57-df-omega</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-phi-e-—-Universal-Turing-Machine-Index-Function\">df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Index Function</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>。固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" href=\"?note=5d66bf24ea0c6e5a\" title=\"90-df-program-numbering\">90-df-program-numbering</a> 的同一程序编号、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"48b1cea94ba27d41\" href=\"?note=48b1cea94ba27d41\" title=\"90-df-t-predicate\">90-df-t-predicate</a> 的实际计算历史关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a> 的输出函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>，不得仅因下标相同而另换编号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(n)}\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(n)}\\)</span> 为部分函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 默认为一元实例；带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元输入的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(\\vec x)\">\\(\\varphi_e(\\vec x)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\vec x)\">\\(\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\vec x)\\)</span> 的元数重载。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(n)}\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,z)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\land U(s)=z)\\},\\qquad\n\\varphi_e\\coloneqq\\varphi_e^{(1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e^{(n)}\\coloneqq\\{(\\vec x,z)\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\n\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\land U(s)=z)\\},\\qquad\n\\varphi_e\\coloneqq\\varphi_e^{(1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)})=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)})=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\vec x)\\downarrow\\leftrightarrow\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)})\\to\n\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\vec x)=U\\!\\left(\\min\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e^{(n)})\\to\n\\varphi_e^{(n)}(\\vec x)=U\\!\\left(\\min\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:T_n(e,\\vec x,s)\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W_e\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PRF}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PartRec}_n,\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e^{(n)}:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{PRF}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W_e\\coloneqq\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{PRF}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PartRec}_n,\\qquad\n\\{\\varphi_e^{(n)}:e\\in\\mathbb N\\}=\\mathrm{PRF}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留部分递归函数与定义域编号，不把偏函数声明成全函数；最小历史码仅在存在历史时取值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-phi-e-—-Universal-Turing-Machine-Index-Function","text":"df-phi-e — Universal Turing Machine Index Function","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"8105afc544202519","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-normal-form-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"73df8af25850d4b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-normal-form-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-min-operator","status":"resolved","id":"65cecff06a8bc84e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excer